@startuml breadpan-stop
participant 消费方
participant breadpan
participant "D-Bus 会话总线" as bus

== 优雅退出 ==
消费方 -> breadpan: shutdown()
breadpan -> bus: 释放 Watcher 名
breadpan -> breadpan: 内部处理（清空簿记、关闭事件通道）
breadpan --> 消费方: 通道关闭（recv → None）

== Displaced / Fatal ==
bus -> breadpan: NameOwnerChanged / 总线断连
breadpan -> breadpan: 内部处理（清空簿记、关闭事件通道）
breadpan --> 消费方: Displaced / Fatal
@enduml
